{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Welcome to Void Authority \u2013 The Universe\u2019s Most Dangerous Desk Job.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the lone inspector at a dusty border checkpoint orbiting a forgotten world, you\u2019ll face aliens with stories, secrets, and suspicious cargo. Will you uphold interstellar law, take a bribe, or let rebels slip through to fuel a quiet revolution?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/70ddde3ba0987be96f5268eefc3aee1e.poster.avif?t=1774555680\" width=780 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/70ddde3ba0987be96f5268eefc3aee1e.webm?t=1774555680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Interrogate and Inspect</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/fa32697acdd4235d0640242ea93daf50.poster.avif?t=1774555680\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871110/extras/fa32697acdd4235d0640242ea93daf50.webm?t